  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and given plane is parallel to line passing through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, normal vector to the plane is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mn>16</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mn>14</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>Equation of plane</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p>Now satisfying the points from option in the plane we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;only point which satisfy the plane.&nbsp;</p></blockquote>"
